&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If it fails: see &lt;a href="https://circleci-labs.github.io/runner-job-wrapper/docs/operate/troubleshooting/"&gt;Troubleshooting&lt;/a&gt;. To roll back, install the previous copy the same way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="uninstall"&gt;Uninstall&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="uninstall"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#uninstall" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remove the prefix first, so no job calls a missing file. On the runner host:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 1. delete the command_prefix lines from the runner config, then&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo systemctl restart circleci-runner
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 2. remove the wrapper, the unit, rotation and settings&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo systemctl disable --now circleci-job-wrapper-hostcache.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo rm /etc/systemd/system/circleci-job-wrapper-hostcache.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo rm /etc/logrotate.d/circleci-job-wrapper
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo rm /usr/local/bin/circleci-job-wrapper
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo rm -r /etc/circleci-job-wrapper
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo systemctl daemon-reload&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The logs in &lt;code&gt;/var/log/circleci-job-wrapper&lt;/code&gt; stay until you delete them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="run-the-tests"&gt;Run the tests&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="run-the-tests"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#run-the-tests" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;make check&lt;/code&gt; runs shellcheck and the bats tests. It needs &lt;code&gt;bats&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;python3&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;code&gt;strace&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;iconv&lt;/code&gt; are used when present.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>